 wants to see them back on their feet!","variant_male_record_index":"171801","variant_female_record_index":"171802","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"document:3:245:0":{"text":"Peel the <style=\"highlight\">grimberry</style> and mash the flesh into a juicy pulp. Add the <style=\"highlight\">rock moss</style> and grind clockwise until fully dissolved. Finally, remove the stems from the <style=\"highlight\">fuzzy mushroom</style>, add them to the mixture, and simmer gently before letting it cool.","source_cn":"将<style=\"highlight\">苦叶果</style>去皮处理，果肉锤捣成汁液状。 加入<style=\"highlight\">石髓苔藓</style>，顺时针研磨融化。最后把<style=\"highlight\">厚褶的茸茸伞菇</style>切除菌柄，加入汁液中慢煮后冷却。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D57320081EE5CF8","variant_status":"","male":"Peel the <style=\"highlight\">grimberry</style> and mash the flesh into a juicy pulp. Add the <style=\"highlight\">rock moss</style> and grind clockwise until fully dissolved. Finally, remove the stems from the <style=\"highlight\">fuzzy mushroom</style>, add them to the mixture, and simmer gently before letting it cool.","female":"Peel the <style=\"highlight\">grimberry</style> and mash the flesh into a juicy pulp. Add the <style=\"highlight\">rock moss</style> and grind clockwise until fully dissolved. Finally, remove the stems from the <style=\"highlight\">fuzzy mushroom</style>, add them to the mixture, and simmer gently before letting it cool.","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"Healing Ointment Formula","document_title_male":"Healing Ointment Formula","document_title_female":"Healing Ointment Formula","document_title_cn":"愈合伤药配方","document_title_status":"matched"},"narration:7:1220928001:0":{"text":"A short while later...","source_cn":"一小段时间之后……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EDC2F16AB5C6E0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_ind